## 5. Explicit non-claims (anti-greenwash)

1. **Cap token migration ≠ product feature.** WireGuard/mTLS/Modbus/MISRA/etc. remain fail-closed stubs after granular rename.
2. **No full std least-privilege.** 344 SysCap files remain; ~206 overbroad pure is real debt.
3. **No ProcessCap std adoption yet** (`&ProcessCap` count = 0 in external std).
4. **No OS isolation** — process-local seals only (CAP-G5).
5. **Hard NetCap residual is intentional** for AF_PACKET / L2 GOOSE — not incomplete homework.
6. **BindCap** not exercised by this 16-set; product `ooda/std/os/net.oo` owns listen bind.

